The ROM set for the 86Box emulator: BIOS, option ROM and font images
for most machines and devices supported by 86Box, including systems
from IBM, Compaq, Amstrad, Tandy, Olivetti, Packard Bell and many
others.

The ROMs are installed into share/86Box/roms, which is one of the
default search paths of 86Box.

